WEBVTT

00:00:01.230 --> 00:00:04.230
I've been wondering... What's
that look on your face?

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:07.940
I've never met an enemy as strong as you!

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:10.980
I'm so excited I can't control myself!

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:13.060
Fascinating.

00:00:15.380 --> 00:00:18.830
Let me show you something
you'll enjoy, then.

00:00:19.200 --> 00:00:21.510
Hades Army.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:29.240
Black magic. Classy.

00:00:30.480 --> 00:00:33.850
Now you no longer have superior numbers.

00:00:33.850 --> 00:00:36.950
If anything, we're the ones
who are outnumbered now!

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:41.050
Now, let's see what you have to offer.

00:00:54.240 --> 00:00:57.120
Black Summoner

00:02:18.450 --> 00:02:20.770
They're all as strong as Rank B monsters.

00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.680
I'll take them out before they get close!

00:02:24.680 --> 00:02:25.810
Wind Shot!

00:02:32.810 --> 00:02:35.770
With all these enemies,
we might break a bone or two.

00:02:36.180 --> 00:02:37.890
Hopefully, one of theirs!

00:02:41.470 --> 00:02:44.090
His jokes are terrible, but he hits hard!

00:02:44.090 --> 00:02:45.710
His jokes are terrible, though.

00:02:48.420 --> 00:02:51.130
My King, take out the ones I miss!

00:02:51.130 --> 00:02:52.250
Leave it to me!

00:02:54.260 --> 00:02:56.180
Wonderful.

00:02:56.180 --> 00:03:00.230
They're all powerful, but not only that,
they move in perfect harmony.

00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:06.700
You're so young, but you fight like
a warrior with years of experience!

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:12.500
You don't seem too scared, huh?

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.420
Which means you've got more to show me.

00:03:14.420 --> 00:03:17.580
That's what you're hoping, right?

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.390
You in the black robe,

00:03:19.390 --> 00:03:22.490
you seem to be quite the battle junkie.

00:03:22.490 --> 00:03:26.170
You've been like that ever
since the fight began.

00:03:26.170 --> 00:03:29.620
It's a sickness, of sorts.

00:03:29.620 --> 00:03:31.880
I'm having so much fun
I can't control myself!

00:03:31.880 --> 00:03:35.960
Let me wipe that smile off your face, then!

00:03:37.720 --> 00:03:39.260
He used it as a smoke bomb?

00:03:39.260 --> 00:03:40.530
Calm down, Gerard.

00:03:40.530 --> 00:03:42.120
I'm tracking him.

00:03:42.520 --> 00:03:45.520
He's coming up from
underground to attack us!

00:03:48.850 --> 00:03:50.500
He sensed me?

00:03:50.830 --> 00:03:52.480
You ain't going anywhere!

00:03:53.330 --> 00:03:54.450
Nice!

00:04:07.710 --> 00:04:11.670
His armor's strong, and he also
has 50% Slash Damage Resist.

00:04:12.370 --> 00:04:14.370
Gerard's a bad match-up for him.

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:18.580
This next one is much
faster than the last one.

00:04:28.480 --> 00:04:29.120
Clotho!

00:04:31.040 --> 00:04:32.790
A slime?

00:04:32.790 --> 00:04:36.530
Looks like physical attacks
don't work so well on you.

00:04:36.530 --> 00:04:38.710
So how about magic absorption?

00:04:40.250 --> 00:04:41.840
Get off me!

00:04:41.840 --> 00:04:43.200
No, you don't!

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:45.360
Glory's Sanctuary!

00:04:48.700 --> 00:04:52.100
I had no idea you possessed such power...

00:04:53.770 --> 00:04:55.780
Well done, My King.

00:04:56.140 --> 00:04:58.560
It won't hold him for long, though.

00:05:04.500 --> 00:05:06.060
He's so damn strong!

00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:06.830
Gerard!

00:05:06.830 --> 00:05:08.270
By your leave...

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:10.110
Vortex Edge!

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:19.120
You're not paying attention, are you?

00:05:21.710 --> 00:05:23.410
I win!

00:05:23.820 --> 00:05:25.220
Nope.

00:05:25.220 --> 00:05:26.610
You lose.

00:05:26.610 --> 00:05:27.390
Efil!

00:05:27.390 --> 00:05:28.280
Right!

00:05:29.050 --> 00:05:32.720
Stealth so strong that I can't detect it?

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:35.650
Shoot him through... Blaze Arrow!

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.030
We're not done yet!

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:56.030
Well done! But Glory's Sanctuary expired.

00:05:56.030 --> 00:05:57.420
Fall back!

00:06:04.350 --> 00:06:09.130
You're the second one to
do this much damage to me.

00:06:09.130 --> 00:06:14.640
It seems all the peace in this
era has dulled my edge...

00:06:15.040 --> 00:06:17.280
Giving up, then?

00:06:18.360 --> 00:06:21.040
Already?

00:06:21.040 --> 00:06:24.450
You're a battle junkie. You must be joking.

00:06:24.450 --> 00:06:27.270
The battle's only getting started.

00:06:30.180 --> 00:06:33.570
Djinn Scrimmage!

00:06:35.070 --> 00:06:36.100
My Lord!

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:38.380
Yeah, we're not waiting for
him to finish casting that.

00:06:38.650 --> 00:06:40.400
Cleft Detonation!

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:44.320
Pyrohydra Primary!

00:06:47.240 --> 00:06:48.510
Agito!

00:06:50.670 --> 00:06:52.400
Just a little too late?

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.290
What power is he using?

00:06:55.290 --> 00:06:58.050
Gerard, turn your Loyalty
skill up to full power.

00:06:58.050 --> 00:07:00.650
Your sure? It won't last long.

00:07:00.960 --> 00:07:02.970
You'll need it to survive that thing!

00:07:03.420 --> 00:07:07.070
It's time for the final round, then.

00:07:07.070 --> 00:07:09.480
Yeah. Give me all you've got!

00:07:09.790 --> 00:07:11.410
Of course!

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:13.320
Gerard! Emergency Defense!

00:07:14.250 --> 00:07:16.050
Earthen Rampart!

00:07:19.670 --> 00:07:23.620
Gerard, if you can't block that
attack, the party will collapse!

00:07:23.620 --> 00:07:25.730
Give it all you've got!

00:07:25.730 --> 00:07:29.210
You're a demanding taskmaster, Princess.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:32.450
But a real knight would never lose here!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.990
You're a fool!

00:07:44.750 --> 00:07:47.720
Gerard, don't give up!

00:07:47.720 --> 00:07:49.580
I'm with you!

00:07:50.680 --> 00:07:52.150
That's right.

00:07:52.150 --> 00:07:56.800
We're still... We're still
just getting started!

00:07:59.150 --> 00:08:00.660
He's still coming!

00:08:01.460 --> 00:08:03.060
Secondary!

00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:07.240
You don't know when to give up, do you?

00:08:07.240 --> 00:08:09.880
Yeah, 'cause we're confident we'll win!

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:13.380
That slime again?

00:08:13.690 --> 00:08:15.530
Hit 'em, Clotho!

00:08:18.970 --> 00:08:22.520
Why do you have so many cursed weapons?

00:08:22.910 --> 00:08:24.950
They're failures from when I
was training Blacksmithing!

00:08:24.950 --> 00:08:26.720
Surprisingly handy, huh?

00:08:27.020 --> 00:08:28.350
This is it!

00:08:28.350 --> 00:08:30.930
Radiance Lancer!

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:32.820
Blaze Arrow!

00:09:11.370 --> 00:09:15.150
You win.

00:09:15.330 --> 00:09:17.590
I want to ask you something.

00:09:17.590 --> 00:09:19.160
What?

00:09:19.160 --> 00:09:24.530
You weren't really going to eat the
Demon King's daughter, were you?

00:09:25.300 --> 00:09:26.870
Why lie?

00:09:27.200 --> 00:09:31.920
If I didn't, you wouldn't
have fought me so hard.

00:09:31.920 --> 00:09:36.340
And Gustav entrusted her to me...

00:09:36.690 --> 00:09:45.520
Several hundred years ago, I was
appointed to be her caretaker.

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:51.070
Name: Victor
Level: 86 Title: He Who Steals
HP 1525/1525
MP 883/883
Age: 670 | Strength 540
Race: Archdemon | Endurance 628
Sex: Male | Agility 378
Class: Arcane Pugilist | Magic 396
Luck 437
Skills:
Gluttony (Unique Skill) | Pugilism (S) |Black Magic (A) | Sense Danger (B) | Armor (A)
Expand/Contract (B) | Earth Dive (B) | 50% Dark Damage Resist | 50% Slashing Damage Resist
Assist Effects:
Gluttony/White Magic (F) | Gluttony/Penetrate (F) | Gluttony/Bloodsucker (E) Gluttony/Stealth (F)
Gluttony/Detection (E) | Gluttony/Dark Vision (D) Gluttony/Hardness (F) | Gluttony/Toughness (E)
Gluttony/Iron Wall (F) Gluttony/Hyper-Agile (F)

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:51.070
Black Summoner

00:09:53.680 --> 00:09:56.300
Your punches aren't carrying
your magic with them.

00:09:56.300 --> 00:09:58.650
And your windup is too slow.

00:10:00.150 --> 00:10:04.790
You'll never make it as an Arcane
Pugilist​ if you have to rely on your skills.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:07.070
Ow!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:11.500
I don't know what it means to
put my magic into my punches!

00:10:12.490 --> 00:10:16.850
If you picked it up right away,
then what would I have to teach you?

00:10:16.850 --> 00:10:18.900
Let's take our time training.

00:10:18.900 --> 00:10:22.120
We demons live long lives.

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:23.730
Long lives, huh?

00:10:25.210 --> 00:10:29.650
Am I going to spend my whole
life in this mansion?

00:10:29.650 --> 00:10:32.810
Father comes to see me every day,

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:36.480
but when he leaves for work,
he doesn't come back for a while.

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.120
Princess Sera...

00:10:38.850 --> 00:10:46.250
Gustav kept his daughter hidden, so his
enemies couldn't use her against him.

00:10:48.650 --> 00:10:52.570
Once you're done eating,
it's back to sparring.

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:53.630
Okay!

00:10:56.380 --> 00:11:00.710
She had no friends.
She never left the house.

00:11:00.710 --> 00:11:05.090
This mansion was all she knew.

00:11:05.090 --> 00:11:11.250
And then one day, the hero attacked
and finally came for Gustav.

00:11:11.250 --> 00:11:14.240
The enemy's armies were vast,
and the castle had almost fallen.

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:19.170
But I believed that fighting and
dying for my master

00:11:19.170 --> 00:11:21.730
would be the best death I could have.

00:11:21.730 --> 00:11:31.990
But my master, King Gustav, ordered me
to continue to watch over Sera.

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:35.080
If her existence became known,

00:11:35.080 --> 00:11:39.200
not only would the hero come after
her, but other demons, as well.

00:11:39.200 --> 00:11:44.980
So the Demon King put a seal on
her that only humans could break.

00:11:44.980 --> 00:11:49.310
Compared to demons and monsters,
humans are weak.

00:11:49.310 --> 00:11:55.920
If anyone but the hero found
her, she would be safe.

00:11:55.920 --> 00:12:00.370
When he died, the magic he'd cast activated,

00:12:00.370 --> 00:12:04.940
and Princess Sera was
sent to a faraway land,

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:09.990
so she could live happily in the
peaceful era that would someday come.

00:12:10.210 --> 00:12:14.460
My liege, that's so... selfish!

00:12:14.460 --> 00:12:17.490
Do you think that will make her happy?

00:12:19.240 --> 00:12:24.830
That's why she's here, in this hidden place.

00:12:24.830 --> 00:12:28.610
I waited and waited, for the
day when the hero would die

00:12:28.610 --> 00:12:31.150
and the war would become
but a distant memory.

00:12:31.150 --> 00:12:33.890
An era of peace and weakness.

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:40.510
An era where Princess Sera could
rule as the new Demon King!

00:12:46.110 --> 00:12:50.940
But... my plan failed.

00:12:52.730 --> 00:12:55.660
I have a last request.

00:12:55.660 --> 00:12:59.970
Would you let her join your party?

00:13:00.870 --> 00:13:02.260
Where did that come from?

00:13:03.060 --> 00:13:07.490
You're strong and trusted by your friends.

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:09.100
Even monsters...

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:13.100
You're a summoner...

00:13:13.980 --> 00:13:15.590
You noticed?

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:23.290
Princess Sera has probably already
awakened from her slumber.

00:13:23.290 --> 00:13:26.810
Break the seal, and her eyes will open soon.

00:13:26.810 --> 00:13:29.610
She's probably hearing what
we're saying right now.

00:13:31.210 --> 00:13:32.840
He's telling the truth.

00:13:32.840 --> 00:13:35.760
Do you want to be my servant, too?

00:13:36.210 --> 00:13:38.300
If so, I'll heal you.

00:13:39.300 --> 00:13:42.120
An attractive offer,

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:45.280
but I serve only the Demon King.

00:13:45.280 --> 00:13:49.010
And it's too late, anyway.

00:13:50.970 --> 00:14:00.070
Please... show Princess Sera the world!

00:14:07.320 --> 00:14:11.500
Master, it's possible she'll
become the Demon King!

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:16.200
I really made a mess of this...

00:14:33.180 --> 00:14:36.510
Now then, can you hear me?

00:14:38.980 --> 00:14:44.090
My father... Victor...
They're all so stupid!

00:14:49.860 --> 00:14:55.090
Victor... I will grant your request.

00:14:58.200 --> 00:15:00.920
Black Summoner

00:15:04.490 --> 00:15:05.570
Kelvin!

00:15:06.590 --> 00:15:07.750
Urd!

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:09.220
It turn out okay?

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:12.380
Yeah. We got rid of the
demon, but it was close.

00:15:12.380 --> 00:15:13.230
Efil.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:17.940
That's...

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:19.400
Here's the proof.

00:15:19.870 --> 00:15:22.730
Have them appraise it at the
guild, and they'll tell you.

00:15:22.730 --> 00:15:25.460
I see. I'm glad you're safe.

00:15:25.460 --> 00:15:26.560
Who's that?

00:15:27.690 --> 00:15:32.360
It looks like the demon was
possessing her when it was sealed.

00:15:32.360 --> 00:15:35.810
She was probably what the first
party of adventurers saw.

00:15:36.740 --> 00:15:38.440
The Camouflaging Hairband.

00:15:38.790 --> 00:15:42.080
It keeps them from seeing her
demon horns and wings...

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:45.450
Gustav probably prepared it for her.

00:15:45.450 --> 00:15:47.730
Out of love for his daughter?

00:15:48.330 --> 00:15:52.080
She seems like she's badly weakened,
so I'm taking her back.

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:53.510
Can you guys...

00:15:53.740 --> 00:15:56.310
Yeah, we'll handle things here.

00:16:00.480 --> 00:16:03.680
Your knight looks pretty worn down, too.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:07.170
Yeah, I guess...

00:16:17.930 --> 00:16:19.830
I feel so much better.

00:16:19.830 --> 00:16:22.460
I think something almost leaked.

00:16:22.460 --> 00:16:26.250
That's the first thing you say after
you evolve and I resummon you?

00:16:26.250 --> 00:16:27.980
What do you expect from me?

00:16:27.980 --> 00:16:31.010
My level went up, and I was
on the verge of evolving.

00:16:31.290 --> 00:16:34.350
Clotho looked strange just
before evolving, too.

00:16:35.070 --> 00:16:36.730
Abyssal Knight Commander.

00:16:36.730 --> 00:16:40.730
A rare variant of the Abyssal Knight,
a monster that only appears in S-Rank dungeons.

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:45.730
Name: Gerard
Level: 80 Title: Patriot Guardian
HP 2130/2130
MP 411/411
Age: 138 | Strength 1044
Race: Abyssal Knight Commander | Endurance 1109
Sex: Male | Agility 373
Class: Dark Knight| Magic 277
Luck 290

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:45.730
Skills:
Loyalty (Unique) | Self-Modification (Unique)
