Armor (B) Military Leadership (A) | Instruction (B)
Toughness (C) | Unbreakable Wall (A) | Manifest Physical Form
50% Dark Damage Resist | 50% Slashing Damage Resist
Assist Effects:
Self-Modification/Dreadnought+ | Self-Modification/Crimson Cape+
Summoning/Magic Supply (S) | Concealment (S)

00:16:40.730 --> 00:16:43.100
And look at those stats!

00:16:43.100 --> 00:16:45.230
That's pretty impressive!

00:16:45.230 --> 00:16:50.650
His broken shield is repaired...
No, I think it's even stronger!

00:16:51.760 --> 00:16:54.730
This is my reward for upholding
the ideals of chivalry!

00:16:54.730 --> 00:16:58.180
You were shaking like you were about
to piss yourself just a moment ago!

00:16:58.180 --> 00:16:59.170
What?

00:17:05.010 --> 00:17:07.840
Seems like you've finally calmed down, Sera.

00:17:07.840 --> 00:17:09.070
Yes.

00:17:09.070 --> 00:17:14.560
But are you sure you want the daughter
of Demon King Gustav as a servant?

00:17:14.560 --> 00:17:18.290
I know I shouldn't be telling you this,
but if they find out, you'll be in big trouble!

00:17:18.290 --> 00:17:21.300
I've got Rank-S Concealment!

00:17:21.300 --> 00:17:24.560
So you don't have to worry about someone
using Appraising Eye on you to see your status.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:27.480
It was amazing enough that
you defeated Victor.

00:17:27.480 --> 00:17:29.250
Who are you?

00:17:29.250 --> 00:17:31.100
You're not the hero, right?

00:17:31.400 --> 00:17:33.260
The hero is somebody else, I guess.

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:37.420
I'm just an adventurer who
likes to fight a little.

00:17:37.420 --> 00:17:38.800
"A little"?

00:17:38.800 --> 00:17:40.360
Why did you all say that at once?

00:17:42.230 --> 00:17:43.790
You really are strange.

00:17:45.020 --> 00:17:46.500
Ready to go?

00:17:46.500 --> 00:17:50.340
I've never been to a town before.

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:53.300
I never even left the mansion.

00:17:53.850 --> 00:17:55.330
You nervous?

00:17:55.740 --> 00:17:56.850
A little.

00:17:56.850 --> 00:18:00.130
Don't worry. They're all good people.

00:18:00.130 --> 00:18:01.920
Yeah. You'll get used to them quick.

00:18:03.210 --> 00:18:05.540
All right. I'll do my best.

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:09.330
This is Parth.

00:18:09.330 --> 00:18:11.310
The town where we live.

00:18:12.770 --> 00:18:14.330
Hey, what's that?

00:18:14.330 --> 00:18:16.060
A fruit seller!

00:18:16.060 --> 00:18:18.370
They have a lot of different fruits there!

00:18:18.370 --> 00:18:19.920
What about that?

00:18:19.920 --> 00:18:21.270
A weapons shop.

00:18:21.270 --> 00:18:25.660
They've got all kinds of stuff,
from standard swords to staves for mages.

00:18:25.660 --> 00:18:27.790
Hey, what about that, then?

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:31.300
Make sure you don't crash into anyone.

00:18:31.810 --> 00:18:33.360
I was worried for nothing.

00:18:33.360 --> 00:18:34.530
I guess so.

00:18:37.460 --> 00:18:38.920
You're having fun, huh?

00:18:38.920 --> 00:18:41.550
It's the first time I've been outside!

00:18:41.550 --> 00:18:43.810
Of course it's fun!

00:18:44.060 --> 00:18:47.580
I've never seen any of these things!

00:18:47.580 --> 00:18:50.630
So much culture and trade,
packed inside this "town"!

00:18:50.630 --> 00:18:52.450
It's all so fascinating...

00:18:53.330 --> 00:18:54.680
Hey, what's that?

00:18:55.500 --> 00:18:58.270
It's her first time in a new world, huh?

00:19:00.800 --> 00:19:04.390
Efil, take Sera back to the inn.

00:19:04.830 --> 00:19:06.920
I'm going to the guild to make my report.

00:19:06.920 --> 00:19:09.770
All right. Leave her to me.

00:19:09.770 --> 00:19:11.720
Kelvin! Efil!

00:19:11.720 --> 00:19:14.410
Hey, I want to go look
over there! Hurry! Hurry!

00:19:14.410 --> 00:19:16.100
Okay, Sera!

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.810
You don't have to be so loud.
I can hear you just fine.

00:19:19.080 --> 00:19:20.960
Don't treat me like a little kid.

00:19:20.960 --> 00:19:23.170
I'm older than you!

00:19:26.750 --> 00:19:30.340
After this quest, I was promoted to Rank A.

00:19:30.770 --> 00:19:35.140
I was told that if the demon that was
discovered was found to be Rank A or greater,

00:19:35.550 --> 00:19:38.790
they were going to use it as a
test for the promotion exam.

00:19:41.050 --> 00:19:41.990
I'm back...

00:19:41.990 --> 00:19:44.410
Our star has arrived!

00:19:44.940 --> 00:19:46.500
Welcome back, Kelvin!

00:19:46.500 --> 00:19:47.940
Congratulations on...

00:19:47.940 --> 00:19:50.200
...making Rank A!

00:19:50.470 --> 00:19:54.340
Ange heard about my promotion to Rank A

00:19:54.340 --> 00:19:57.710
and held a party for me
at the Spirit's Song Inn.

00:19:58.100 --> 00:20:02.790
Sera didn't seem to know how to handle
seeing all these people at once.

00:20:03.090 --> 00:20:07.510
Efil and Claire seemed to be having
some kind of strange competition.

00:20:07.750 --> 00:20:11.010
And I also found out that
Claire and Urd were married!

00:20:11.340 --> 00:20:14.990
And people were very suspicious about my
relationship with Sera, the new girl.

00:20:15.530 --> 00:20:21.060
I had so much fun with all the
craziness that time flew by...

00:20:35.050 --> 00:20:36.100
Sera?

00:20:41.190 --> 00:20:43.000
Hey, Victor...

00:20:43.400 --> 00:20:47.880
The outside world is really
loud and noisy, isn't it?

00:20:48.410 --> 00:20:50.310
But... yeah.

00:20:50.860 --> 00:20:55.030
It's a lot more fun than I thought.
It's all so new.

00:20:57.860 --> 00:20:59.320
It's so big!

00:21:00.120 --> 00:21:03.240
There's a big puddle here...

00:21:03.240 --> 00:21:05.790
I'll have to ask the gardeners
to do something about it.

00:21:06.150 --> 00:21:09.920
Hey, the thing they call the
"sea" is a lot bigger, right?

00:21:09.920 --> 00:21:11.170
I read that in a book!

00:21:11.170 --> 00:21:12.880
That's right.

00:21:12.880 --> 00:21:16.540
It's just water as far as the eye can see.

00:21:16.540 --> 00:21:20.760
Wow! I wonder if I'll ever get to see it!

00:21:20.760 --> 00:21:22.450
You will, of course!

00:21:22.450 --> 00:21:28.100
And when you do, I, Victor,
will be there to teach you how to swim!

00:21:29.130 --> 00:21:31.110
It's a promise, Victor!

00:21:32.300 --> 00:21:34.420
Sera, what are you doing?

00:21:34.630 --> 00:21:36.760
This is how you have fun at the sea, right?

00:21:36.760 --> 00:21:38.550
You join in, too, Victor!

00:21:38.550 --> 00:21:40.980
W-Wait! Sera!

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:43.210
Stop it...

00:21:43.210 --> 00:21:45.490
Your clothes are getting soaked...

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:49.440
That's right... I want
to go see the sea, too.

00:21:50.080 --> 00:21:53.490
The mountains, other towns,
other continents...

00:21:54.200 --> 00:21:58.950
I'll live the best life I can in the
world that you and my father gave me.

00:22:01.260 --> 00:22:02.720
So watch over me!

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:09.720
EP 05: Daughter of the Demon King
